                  "description": {
                    "value": "An ephemeral, taloned hand grips the target, burning it with magical acid. The target takes 2d8 acid damage plus 1d6 persistent acid damage depending on its Reflex save. A creature taking persistent damage from this spell takes a \u201310-foot status bonus to its Speeds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage and no persistent damage, and the claw moves it up to 5 feet in a direction of your choice.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and persistent damage, and the claw moves it up to 10 feet in a direction of your choice.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and full persistent damage, and the claw moves it up to 20 feet in a direction of your choice."
                  },
                  "higher_level_description": {
                    "value": "Heightened (+2): The initial damage increases by 2d8, and the persistent acid damage increases by 1d6."
